Z||000002||G-Nasty||10-13-2001||02:17 AM||||Bought Accel from Fierostore...thing burned out after a month for some reason-they replaced free of charge and I still havent sent back bad one...Top end performance increase -theres enough spark for speeds over 110, also some audible detonation but the new yellow coil kicks ass-<BR>Also factory ign module burned up after 2 weeks w/ new coil. They tend to go bad after 13 yrs anyway. The wrecker bill on both these instances hurt-Good Luck||||reg||1
Z||000003||camon||10-13-2001||02:43 AM||||Yeah I seen the other post (read a few of them)....I posted this because I would like people that have used the accel with 2.8's to see what performance they got and problems they experienced. My mind still isn't 100% made up (accel or MSD). MSD is a better choice from what i've been reading. But it also costs more (I beleive). I was also looking for plugs and how they perform. I seen Rapidfires mentioned often so I may go with them.<P>Also was the module failure a direct result of the new coil (if you know for sure)...and what did you replace it with (another stock module or is there an aftermarket product)....just curious?????<P>Thanks again!<p>[This message has been edited by camon (edited 10-13-2001).]||||reg||1
